      \vspace #0.88
      \line { \bold "3." \column { "“Where is the truth?” I asked; for this I longed:" "None answered right ’mid all the answering throng;" "For ever side by side lay light and shade." "“Where is,” I cried, “the one communion pure?" "Where is the Church in which, clear-traced and sure," "The Spirit’s very likeness is portrayed?”" } }
      \vspace #0.88
